ps, set vendor_scope to \"QuoteStream\" on the opened `vendor_intake_form` widget, then add a note \"Vendor Intake Live\" saying: \"Vendor Intake Live is live from Vendor SLA Data: vendor intake ready.\"",
  "subdomain": "operations",
  "title": "Ship, open, and configure the Vendor Intake Live form app",
  "widget_hints": {},
  "workflow": "vendor-sla-monitoring"
}

